Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.94,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:05.46,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.909,334.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3860,4980)}Episode 40
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:05.78,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.909,531.818)\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3860,4980)}Capture of Nán Commandery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Congratulations, General, for you have accomplished a miracle by destroying a great evil for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:38.46,Style Names,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(971.363,436.363)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,4450,4780)}Zhūgé Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have this cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.70,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I displeased you by not greeting you sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.10,0:00:48.38,Style Names,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(892.935,503.186)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúnchǎng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you not report this sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General, no need to quibble over this. Please have this drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.30,0:01:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to ask for death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Cao Cao did not go through Huarong Road?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He did pass by.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,However, for my incompetence, he slipped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:26.94,Style Names,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(328.312,492.468)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely, it must be for his fighting generals that rescued him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.82,0:01:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, have you captured a great general of Cao Cao then?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.82,0:01:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, none were captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seized any weapons, grain, or treasures?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.06,0:01:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,None either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you, on account of the past kindness,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.58,0:01:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,purposely let Cao Cao go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know your crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.78,0:02:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Since there is a military pledge, \Nwe will do as according to military law.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him out...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Off with his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, please have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:43.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(957.727,511.363)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,4000,4000)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:50.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(348.879,531.428)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2660,2980)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.22,0:02:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:02:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:10.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Strategos, we three had sworn the oath in the peach garden:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"though not born together, we will die together!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang has broken the military law, \Nbut I cannot betray our vow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope the Strategos can show mercy, \Nand let him redeem himself with future merits!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:03:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,what else could I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:48.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(954.537,486.233)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2660,3020)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You have all protected me with your very lives, \Nyour efforts are immeasurable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, everyone, rest early.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:21.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The division of the realm into three is yet to be fulfilled,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.94,0:05:25.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,for our strength is not comparable to Cao Cao or Sun Quan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao must be defeated, but must not be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If he dies, the north will fall into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan would then have a chance to seize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That would endanger your goal of uniting the realm, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.86,0:05:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,After the burning at Chibi, Cao Cao would have led his remnants through Huarong Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,After meeting General Guan, he would beg for his life, kneeling and crying upon the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan would be overcome with emotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And finally, Cao Cao would, beneath General Guan's blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.18,0:06:00.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,beg for a way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, better to let Yunchang have his mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have his mercy indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:20.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(319.219,503.377)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,3140,3460)}Xún Yōu\NStyled: Gōngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.22,0:06:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you have drunk much tonight, you shouldn't drink any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, whilst in the fires of war, the point \Nbetween life and death, you were unafraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:07:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you are safe inside the city, with men and horses fed well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to gather your forces and march out for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet why are you crying so mournfully without end?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You think I'm crying for myself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:23.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I cry for Guo Jia, Guo Fengxiao!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:25.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(988.878,515.845)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,2222,2222)}Chéng Yù\NStyled: Zhòngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If Fengxiao were here, he would never let me be defeated so utterly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How I lament Fengxiao!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How I ache for Fengxiao!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How I miss Fengxiao!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I will return to the Xu capital for now \Nto reorganize our forces for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Here is a classified order, sealed within this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do not open it until at the most urgent juncture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If there is an emergency, \Nthen proceed as written here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,so that Eastern Wu will not dare to come after Nan Commandery!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your horse, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:25.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(943.609,512.727)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,4000,4000)}Zhōu Yú\NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon my lord's orders, I have come to thank the Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:34.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(302.049,447.273)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,4180,4540)}Sūn Qián\NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We come with a few meager gifts to show our appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Much thanks to Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is your lord now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He has set his camp at Youjiangkou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Would Kongming be at Youjiangkou as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Strategos and my lord are both at Youjiangkou.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.70,0:10:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please return for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I will personally go and thank them another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:30.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(298.927,518.961)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,3220,3620)}Lǔ Sù\NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What has shocked you, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Liu Bei has encamped at Youjiang River, he must mean to take Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We have expended much of our forces and exhausted our grain and coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now Nan Commandery is within our grasp,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,yet he seeks to seize the results of our labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How could we possibly let this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I, Zhou Yu, am alive for one day more...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, how should we respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will deny him personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we can settle this, then it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If not, I will not let him take the Nan Commandery!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.46,0:11:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will eliminate Liu Bei first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to accompany you, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, as per Strategos' orders, the gifts are delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.90,0:11:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu said he will soon come to thank us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Would Zhou Yu deign to come \Nthank us himself for such trivial matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he will be coming for Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If he brings troops, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My liege, as I see it, we should...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is as good of an army commander as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,By order of the Strategos, \NI, Zhao Yun, welcome the Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-Lord Xuande, Mister Kongming! \N-Chief Commander, Zijing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Regarding the great gift yesterday, I am honored!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, I come to say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Such a minor gift is not worth your troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,To ferry across personally, you honor us greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, Zijing, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, Zijing, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, Mister Kongming, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard much of your charms. \NMay you grace us with a performance today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You show me such grace, how could I bear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But since you, sire,\N have moved your troops here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,do you not mean to take the Nan Commandery?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.98,0:14:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We heard that you wanted to take\N Nan Commandery, so we came to your aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.98,0:14:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Chief Commander cannot take it, then I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:05.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Eastern Wu has long sought to annex the Han River.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now that Nan Commandery is within our grasp, how could we not seize it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory and defeat are never certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.82,0:15:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cao Cao had ordered Cao Ren to garrison Nan before he left,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:20.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,he must have prepared a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Moreover, Cao Ren is brave and relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I fear that the Chief Commander is unable to take Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If I cannot take it, then I will\N let you try, however you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.74,0:15:41.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good! Zijing, Kongming can be our witnesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When the time comes, \Nwill you go back on your word?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Once a man has spoken, what regrets can he have?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:15:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chief Commander speaks truly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we will let Eastern Wu have it, but if you cannot,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,then our liege can take it. Is this not agreeable?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.98,0:16:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not renege on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, how could you agree to\N let Liu Xuande take Nan Commandery?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.10,0:16:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Cao army has just been defeated, their morale will be low.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.30,0:16:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Conquering Nan Commandery can be done within the snap of a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I only sold Liu Bei an empty promise. Is that not so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Camp Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Relay my order!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jiang Qin shall be the vanguard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ding Feng and Xu Sheng will be supporting, \Nand will attack Nan Commandery!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.46,0:17:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gan Ning shall attack Yiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Back there, I spoke as you have suggested.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I did spoke as such, though I had ruminated,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand Strategos' intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.98,0:17:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I am alone, without a place to stand on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If Nan Commandery were ours, it could be our sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But if Zhou Yu seizes it, all its cities will belong to Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.34,0:17:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where would be my anchorage?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.66,0:17:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.70,0:17:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When I suggested the sire should take \NJing Province, you refused to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.90,0:18:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does sire want the Nan Commandery now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.74,0:18:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Jing Province was Brother Jingsheng's. \NI could not bear to seize his land.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nan Commandery is Cao Cao's. \NClaiming it is both right and proper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.98,0:18:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let Zhou Gongjin have his battle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But sooner or later, you will be sitting within the walls of Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we left, I stressed to you not to underestimate Cao Ren!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You lost your first engagement with Nan Commandery, and return in defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.74,0:18:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You broke our army's morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tie up Jiang Qin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory and defeat both are common in war. \NI hope you can pardon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.70,0:19:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Nan Commandery and Yiling form the Ox-Horn Formation;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jiang Qin's defeat thus threatens General Gan Ning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Report, Chief Commander. Gan Ning has defeated Cao Hong, seizing Yiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,However, Generals Cao Chun and Niu Jin have rendezvoused with Cao Hong,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,together besieging Gan Ning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Should the Chief Commander send a detachment to aid him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,These are vital strategic areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If we divide our forces to relieve them, and Cao Ren were to come here, how would we respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.02,0:19:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General Gan is a great general of the Southlands! How could we not help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.94,0:19:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will help him personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who can take on the duty of leading our troops here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ling Tong, Ling Gongji,\N can take this responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Would Gongji be able to temporarily perform the duties of the Chief Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.98,0:20:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Within ten days, I can manage.\N Beyond ten days, I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We will sing songs of victory within ten days!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Close the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao troops come out, Cao troops come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao troops come out, Cao troops come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.02,0:21:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General Cao Ren,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu led a regiment to aid Gan Ning and enveloped Yiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they have advanced all the way to \Nthe walls of Nan Commandery! What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.22,0:21:16.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(317.658,388.051)}Cáo Rén\NStyled: Zǐxiào
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.06,0:21:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,With Yiling lost, our position here is critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why not look at the Chancellor's secret order he left us
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.86,0:21:21.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(996.683,483.117)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,3540,3860)}Cáo Hóng\NStyled: Zǐlián
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and save us from this danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.74,0:21:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,By the Chancellor's instructions, \Nwe shall leave Nan Commandery!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.70,0:21:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We have fought so hard! \NHow could we leave so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We will eat during fifth watch! \NAt dawn, pull back all our forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:50.06,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,3:00 AM to 5:00 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.82,0:21:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cover the walls with banners to aggrandize ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, split the troops and sally out of the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.06,0:21:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,670.667)}Zijing's words have reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.38,0:22:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,670.667)}To conquer Nan Commandery, we need to be swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Yiling and Nan Commandery create the Ox Horn Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.86,0:22:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,670.667)}which means they rely on each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.70,0:22:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,670.667)}Today I took Yiling. Cao's army lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}If we do not absorb Nan Commandery before they recover,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.26,0:22:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}they will take back Yiling, \Nthreatening Nan Commandery!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.18,0:22:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Moreover, Liu Bei has been \Ncoveting Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.38,0:22:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}If we do not strike, he shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Even if this were one of Cao Ren's tricks, \Nwe must take Nan Commandery!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,668)}Besides, Cao Ren is an officer but not a strategist.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,665.333)}Even if he had a plan, he won't escape from my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.38,0:22:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Qin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.74,0:22:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and scout out the other three gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.74,0:23:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Cao forces come out from the city tomorrow morning, report to me immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.94,0:23:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.18,0:23:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Zhou Tai, Han Dang! \N-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Engage Cao Hong! \N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.26,0:23:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ding Feng, Xu Sheng! \N-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.86,0:23:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Cut off their rear! \N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.74,0:23:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat, retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.26,0:23:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Their lair is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.14,0:24:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If Cao Ren has retreated, there must be a specific escape route.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.06,0:24:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General, lead the army to defend the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.46,0:24:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If our army prevails, you must intercept Cao Ren's defeated troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.62,0:24:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Cheng, hold formation while I take the city personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.30,0:24:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.30,0:24:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge in!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.74,0:24:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge in!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.38,0:25:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.86,0:25:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.34,0:25:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.30,0:25:38.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(436.293,498.701)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,4180,4540)}Huáng Gài\NStyled: Gōngfù
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.42,0:25:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.62,0:25:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.66,0:25:47.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(970.146,509.61)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,2222,2222)}Cáo Chún\NStyled: Zǐhé
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.90,0:26:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor's calculations are godlike indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.98,0:26:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, I came to check your wounds-
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.42,0:26:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Elder General Cheng has taken several arrows to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.90,0:26:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Treat his wounds first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.26,0:26:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, the Elder General's arrow wounds are not serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.74,0:26:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They will heal completely in about ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.78,0:26:43.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(982.634,417.663)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3220,3580)}Medic
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.82,0:26:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This arrow is poisoned!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.54,0:26:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.14,0:26:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zijing, this arrowhead is poisoned, and it is potent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.02,0:26:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It cannot heal fully in such a short time!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.94,0:27:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he recovers, the poison will harm him again should he stress too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.98,0:27:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there an antidote?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.30,0:27:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a great doctor, \Nsixty {\i1}li{\i0} from Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.94,0:27:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His skills in healing are without equal, and his medicines miraculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.26,0:27:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There is no poison he cannot cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.26,0:27:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I only wonder if he is willing to treat the Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.06,0:27:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is such a miracle doctor, get him here at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.54,0:27:29.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu has been shot and \NCheng Pu has been wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.50,0:27:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The armies of Eastern Wu must be distraught and leaderless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.54,0:27:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us taunt their forces everyday and wait for Zhou Yu's poison to take effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.66,0:27:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, the whole army will attack as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.82,0:27:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be a total victory, and avenge our loss at Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.26,0:27:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.30,0:27:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, Zijing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.70,0:27:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.82,0:27:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, I have been poisoned.\N I cannot lead the troops for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.70,0:28:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That burden must now lie on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.02,0:28:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.42,0:28:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.06,0:28:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Men!\N-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.62,0:28:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Have you sent for the doctor?\N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.98,0:28:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Send a swift cavalry to invite him now! \N-Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.54,0:28:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-If he refuses, tie him up and drag him here! \N-Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.82,0:28:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.14,0:28:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Hong is challenging us outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.18,0:28:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Fly the sign for refusal outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.94,0:28:48.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Tell all officers to hold their position. Execute any violators!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.90,0:28:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.46,0:28:54.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(593.333,472)}Refuse engagement
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.54,0:29:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiangdong depends on that Zhou the Youth!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.66,0:29:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that knave loses his life, \Nthe rest are no better than rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.42,0:29:15.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,666.667)}Southern rats, leave your nests!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.18,0:29:14.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(570.537,210.39)}Refuse engagement
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.34,0:29:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.86,0:29:34.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,673.333)}Zhou the Youth, Zhou the Youth, your end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel Adjutant,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.26,0:29:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the Cao army's unending insults cannot be \Nendured anymore! Let me go and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.74,0:29:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Had I not covered your loss before, \Nyou would long be buried in the earth! Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.38,0:29:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.06,0:29:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.42,0:29:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Strategos, our scouts report, after Zhou Yu took the arrow, the Wu camps have gone quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:30:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Today, Cao Hong stood in front of the \NWu camp, challenging and insulting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.94,0:30:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wu forces hung a sign refusing from battle and kept their troops in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.26,0:30:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow morning, send a fierce warrior-general to smash the Wu camp's refusal sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.94,0:30:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Have all forces beat the drums \Nday and night to worsen Zhou Yu's wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.54,0:30:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This will accelerate his demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.74,0:30:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.10,0:30:27.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth, Zhou the Youth, your end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.86,0:30:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Send Ling Tong to see us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.66,0:30:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.10,0:30:52.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth, Zhou the Youth, your end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.22,0:30:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.22,0:31:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.22,0:31:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard Cao Ren seeks to kill the Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.90,0:31:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hurry, pick rapid archers and tell them to climb the watchtowers and shoot the drummers!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.58,0:31:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Afterwards, sally out and catch them unprepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.38,0:31:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Remember, do not pursue them!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.14,0:31:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.22,0:31:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.74,0:31:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, I can take care of things here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.90,0:31:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.90,0:31:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.58,0:31:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.10,0:31:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you brought the healer?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.66,0:31:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.50,0:31:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Heaven want to end our Eastern Wu!?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.34,0:32:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel Adjutant!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.86,0:32:06.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Though the miracle doctor is out on a trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.86,0:32:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,he left the antidote before he departed!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.30,0:32:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.50,0:32:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He left the antidote!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.98,0:32:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hurry! Hurry! \N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.90,0:32:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth, Zhou the Youth, your end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.22,0:32:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.86,0:32:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.46,0:32:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.50,0:32:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel Adjutant, the Cao have retreated!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.26,0:32:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin is saved! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.66,0:33:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.70,0:33:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, I have burdened everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.98,0:33:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We hope the Chief Commander recovers quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.82,0:33:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth, Zhou the Youth, your end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.54,0:33:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that noise outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.66,0:33:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Military exercises.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.86,0:33:50.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth, Zhou the Youth, your end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.46,0:33:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They are clearly the Cao armies! \NWhy are we not fighting them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.66,0:33:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You barely survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.46,0:34:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The healer urged that with your \Narrow wound, you must not stress yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.38,0:34:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,lest the poison becomes potent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.66,0:34:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not pull back, return to Jiangdong for now, and return another day?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.62,0:34:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.90,0:34:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander! Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.98,0:34:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A great man, who has a fief from their lord, \Nought to repay through blood upon the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.30,0:34:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,returning as a corpse covered in horse skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.62,0:34:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How could we ruin the needs of a nation for the needs of one?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.62,0:34:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.90,0:34:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me to face them in battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.86,0:34:51.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth, Zhou the Youth, your end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.98,0:34:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Those southern rats don't dare leave, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.22,0:35:01.54,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth, Zhou the Youth, your end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.18,0:35:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Zhou the Youth!?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.98,0:35:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Ren, you oaf, do you not recognize Zhou Yu?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.94,0:35:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Louder! Keep yelling!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.54,0:35:41.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth, Zhou the Youth, your end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.34,0:35:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and fight them!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.74,0:35:49.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth, Zhou the Youth, your end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.78,0:35:52.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Commander! Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.62,0:35:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Report! Sires, Zhou Yu went to battle Cao Ren,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.30,0:35:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but his wounds opened, \Nhe fell from his horse, and died!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.02,0:36:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Nan Commandery \Nshall be ours without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.86,0:36:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Zixiao!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.66,0:36:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The scouts report Zhou Yu has died from his arrow wound!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.42,0:36:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Wu camps already began \Nmourning ceremonies for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.90,0:36:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Zhou Yu's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.30,0:37:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It is in the army's main camp. It has not yet been sent back to Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.06,0:37:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.30,0:37:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We will defeat the enemy today!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.70,0:37:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,At the third watch tonight, we will mount a raid
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.70,0:37:11.10,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,11:00 PM to 1:00 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.98,0:37:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,seize Zhou Yu's body, cut off his head,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.70,0:37:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and send it back to Xudu for the Chancellor's reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.06,0:37:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.30,0:37:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge in!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.06,0:37:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge in, take Zhou Yu's body!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.86,0:38:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We fell for their trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.74,0:38:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Ren, you buffoon, your life ends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.62,0:38:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.42,0:38:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.30,0:38:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.02,0:38:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.02,0:38:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gates! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.46,0:38:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.30,0:39:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Zhao Zilong of Changshan!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.66,0:39:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, please do not blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.02,0:39:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the Strategos' command, \NI have taken Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.34,0:39:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, Jing Province's cities have fallen to Zhang Fei!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.14,0:39:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.46,0:39:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How did Zhang Fei take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.70,0:39:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang took the Cao army's tally \Nof Nan Commandery,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.78,0:39:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,forging orders for the Jing Province forces to come for aid,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.62,0:39:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,letting Zhang Fei seize the emptied forts!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.14,0:39:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That peon Zhuge...!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.94,0:39:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, Xiangyang has fallen to Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.82,0:40:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiahou Dun was guarding Xiangyang! How could Liu Bei have taken it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.14,0:40:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang's spy used the Cao tally last night, claiming Cao Ren asked for aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.02,0:40:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They lured Xiahou Dun out of the city, letting Guan Yu conquer Xiangyang!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.06,0:40:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander! Chief Commander!
Comment: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:19.46,Header,,0,0,0,,We could shorten Nan Commandery to just Nan or Nanjun.
Comment: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,ZL181: I want this 'surely' to be kept to show Zhuge Liang's hopeful belief that Guan Yu did not let Cao Cao go.\N Sarracenian: Correction; Zhuge Liang had anticipated this early, and wanted Cao Cao to live so the North wouldn't fall into disorder
Comment: 0,0:14:00.18,0:14:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,可他却要坐享其成
Comment: 0,0:17:45.74,0:17:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如此礼重，瑜安敢受之？
Comment: 0,0:27:14.62,0:27:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ling Tong!
Comment: 0,0:31:24.10,0:31:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lit: How is this good? 这可如何是好啊？

